[00:03.16] [Overdriven Tube Amp Feedback]
[00:06.33] [Drumstick Count: 1-2-3-4]
[00:09.49] (Chrome Pulse!)
[00:13.71] [Verse 1: Gritty Garage Rock Drive]
[00:16.87] I'm here, girl, roast me please, roast me girl, don't hold back, give me what you gave to the rest of the back,
[00:21.09] Don't give a damn what tomorrow brings.
[00:25.31] Turn the master knob up to number ten,
[00:29.53] Kicking down the door just to play again.
[00:33.75] Got cyberpunk locked in the rhythm box,
[00:37.96] Battering the stage in our dirty socks.
[00:42.18] Sweat on the frets and the knuckles raw,
[00:46.40] Breaking every single manufactured law.
[00:50.62] [Pre-Chorus: Building Snare Roll]
[00:53.78] Feel the floor vibrate right through your shoes,
[00:58.00] Nothing on the line that we're scared to lose.
[01:02.22] Kick drum thumping like a heart attack,
[01:06.44] We're on the frontline and we ain't turning back.
[01:10.65] [Chorus: Explosive Full-Band Hook]
[01:13.82] Chrome Pulse! Tear the roof right off!
[01:18.04] Louder than the sirens, louder than the talk!
[01:22.25] Got the 16th clutch pocket locked to the floor,
[01:26.47] That is how the real rock and roll goes!
[01:30.69] (Chrome Pulse!)
[01:34.91] [Verse 2: Driving Rhythm Guitar]
[01:38.07] Three chords roaring on a beat-up wood,
[01:42.29] Playing twice as loud as they said we should.
[01:46.51] Crowd in the pit pushing wall to wall,
[01:50.73] Nobody is scared if they take a fall.
[01:54.95] [Verse 3: Raw Screaming Vocals]
[01:58.11] Midnight curfew went an hour ago,
[02:02.33] Nobody is leaving till the final blow.
[02:06.55] Guitars screeching like a wounded beast,
[02:10.76] Turning every table at the corporate feast.
[02:14.98] [Bridge: Stripped Bass Breakdown]
[02:18.15] [Bass Breakdown & Hi-Hat Chug]
[02:21.31] Hold it for a second... let the feedback grow...
[02:25.53] NOW HIT IT!
[02:29.75] [Final Chorus: Maximum Voltage]
[02:32.91] Chrome Pulse! Tear the roof right off!
[02:37.13] Louder than the sirens, louder than the talk!
[02:41.35] Got the 16th clutch pocket locked to the floor,
[02:45.56] That is how the real rock and roll goes!
[02:49.78] (Chrome Pulse!)
